太也因為抱牠而越來越強壯","n":20,"ssz":"...........1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸說道理","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這件事讓我們明白什麼？","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能力不是一下子練成的，而是每天一點一點累積起來。","n":24,"ssz":"..1.1.1........2...1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要願意聽從師父安排，最後就一定會成功。","n":20,"ssz":"..............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹找證據（單選）","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"故事哪裡可以支持這個道理？","n":13,"ssz":".........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"正太每天抱小豬移動，三年後正太已經可以抱八十公斤豬。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"正太看見武僧打退兩個惡霸，但是卻不願意一開始就教他武功。","n":28,"ssz":".........1......1..2...1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"正太等到自己十四歲了，才到寺廟剃度，接受師父的訓練。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.你發現了嗎？\n正太每天抱小豬，表面上像是在做雜事，其實是在每天承受一點一點增加的挑戰。這些故事線索可以支持這個道理：\n→能力不是一下子練成的，而是每天一點一點累積起來的。","n":87,"ssz":"...................................2....................1.......1.1.1........2...1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.你發現了嗎？","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"正太每天抱小豬，表面上像是在做雜事，其實是在每天承受一點一點增加的挑戰。這些故事線索可以支持這個道理：","n":51,"ssz":"..........................2....................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→能力不是一下子練成的，而是每天一點一點累積起來的。","n":26,"ssz":"...1.1.1........2...1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例二：龜兔賽跑","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"龜兔賽跑","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有一天，烏龜和兔子在聊天，不知不覺說到誰跑得比較快，於是兔子便邀約烏龜比賽跑步。一開始，兔子大幅領先烏龜，但不久後，兔子便開始輕敵，認為即使小睡一下，烏龜仍追趕不上牠，便到路邊睡覺。結果烏龜後來趕上，等到兔子醒了時，烏龜已經到達終點了。","n":118,"ssz":"......1.1............1.......1..........2....1.............1............1.......1........1.............1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.龜兔賽跑這個故事想告訴我們什麼道理？我們用四個步驟來看：","n":30,"ssz":".......1................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"故事一開始，兔子的情況？","n":12,"ssz":"..2....1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"牠一開始落後，急著追上烏龜。","n":14,"ssz":".2............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"牠一開始領先，覺得自己會贏。","n":14,"ssz":".2......1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"後來哪件事最重要？產生什麼影響？","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兔子輕敵去睡覺，烏龜一直走，最後先到終點。","n":21,"ssz":".1....1...2.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兔子跑累去休息，烏龜突然加速，最後先到終點。","n":22,"ssz":".1...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸說道理（3選2）","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"跑得慢的人，只要不放棄就有機會贏。","n":17,"ssz":".1......1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"跑得快的人，就算中途休息也能成功。","n":17,"ssz":".1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[2].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有優勢也不能輕敵，仍要持續努力。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹找證據（複選）","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兔子和烏龜決定比賽跑步。","n":12,"ssz":".11........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兔子一開始領先，輕敵，認為睡一下烏龜也追不上牠。","n":24,"ssz":".12...........1.....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[3].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兔子在路邊睡覺，烏龜後來趕上，先到終點。","n":20,"ssz":".1....1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[3].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兔子天生懶惰，平常最愛睡覺。","n":14,"ssz":".1..........1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.你發現了嗎？\n故事道理不是只看一件事，而是要把一開始的狀況、關鍵事件和結果連起來看，才能知道故事想告訴我們什麼。","n":58,"ssz":".............1...........2..........1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"故事道理不是只看一件事，而是要把一開始的狀況、關鍵事件和結果連起來看，才能知道故事想告訴我們什麼。","n":49,"ssz":"....1...........2..........1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例三：破掉的水桶","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"破掉的水桶","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一個農夫每天用兩個水桶從河裡取水回家，其中一個水桶有裂縫，每次走回家時，它總是漏掉一半的水，而另一個水桶則能保持完整的水量。","n":62,"ssz":"........1.............1....1.............1.......1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"破掉的水桶很自卑，對農夫說：「對不起，我讓你浪費了一半的水。」但農夫笑著回答：「你有沒有注意到，沿路的花都只長在你的那一側？因為你的裂縫讓水滴落在地上，澆灌了這條路旁的花朵，讓我們有了一條美麗的小路！」","n":101,"ssz":".........................1..........................1......1...1...1................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「破掉的水桶」這個故事想告訴我們什麼道理？(可複選)","n":28,"ssz":"..........1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人生應該盡量避免失敗，追求完美才能心靈滿足。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每個人都有自己的價值，不必因為不完美而自卑。","n":22,"ssz":".1.........1..1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"換個角度，不完美的事物也可能有獨特的貢獻。","n":21,"ssz":".1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要你努力達成目標，過程中的小瑕疵並不重要。","n":22,"ssz":"..................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.請想想，哪一組線索最能支持你推論出的道理？(單選)","n":27,"ssz":".......2..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"破水桶一開始很自卑，覺得自己浪費水、沒有用；後來農夫指出，裂縫滴下的水澆灌了路旁的花。","n":43,"ssz":"...2.......1..................1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"破水桶每次回家漏掉一半水；另一個水桶能保持完整水量。","n":26,"ssz":".........1.....1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.你發現了嗎？\n找故事道理時，要先抓住故事裡最重要的線索，再想：這些線索想讓我明白什麼？","n":45,"ssz":"............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.你發現了嗎？","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找故事道理時，要先抓住故事裡最重要的線索，再想：這些線索想讓我明白什麼？","n":36,"ssz":"...................................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"背景","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兩百年前日本奈良，市集。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"起因","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"正太看到僧人制服惡霸，讓他想要去興福寺【　】。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學武功","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經過","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"師父給他【　】，每天讓正太抱著小豬走上走下，持續【　】年，每日不間斷。","n":35,"ssz":"................................1.."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小豬","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"結果","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[3].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三年後，正太變成了【　】，一般的匪徒強盜再也不是他的對手。","n":29,"ssz":".............2........1......"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[3].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"強壯的人/高手","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:story_structure_table[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"正太看到僧人制服惡霸，讓他想要去興福寺【學武功】。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:story_structure_table[3][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"師父給他【小豬】，每天讓正太抱著小豬走上走下，持續【三】年，每日不間斷。","n":36,"ssz":".................................1.."},{"section":"served:story_structure_table[4][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三年後，正太變成了【強壯的人/高手】，一般的匪徒強盜再也不是他的對手。","n":35,"ssz":"...................2........1......"},{"section":"served:video_links[0].title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"影片 1","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:video_links[1].title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"影片 2","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:resources.items[0].title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格教育－勇敢說不","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:r